uthor": {"steamid": "76561198122297062", "personaname": "Stableblackhawk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198122297062/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 11743, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 179, "playtime_at_review": 9304, "last_played": 1787622320, "avatar": "9cf3d52a9728761e55d95971eeb7f0952cd0fdea"}, "language": "english", "review": "What's the goal with this newer version of Helldivers 2??????? Stress the hell out of your players?\r\n\r\nInstant bug breaches and bot drops, and always when you're reloading, a bug or bot calls one in? There's so many other little things they had no issues with until after one update some months ago that messed everything up.", "timestamp_created": 1731714274, "timestamp_updated": 1731714274, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.446410804986953735", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179098713", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970644088", "personaname": "Xiberath", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Evil-Tool/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 17797, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 107, "playtime_at_review": 5478, "last_played": 1787906594, "avatar": "950f9f3147d4c8530a5072825d01c34ee3f1afa1"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you don't play this game, report to your democracy officer immediately.\r\n\r\nThis game is awesome.", "timestamp_created": 1731713592, "timestamp_updated": 1731713592, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32638", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 5500                               ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti", "vram_size": 7891}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179098324", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056272943", "personaname": "Dfog", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056272943/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 13057, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13050, "last_played": 1735541642, "avatar": "8a8944f07115b3b384ad45cfe77118f757b38414"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good Game, Bad Developers\n\nAfter 9 months, it is safe to say that this game is somewhat like a toxic relationship. The game is good but its back and forth with what the developers are doing to the game and it probably will not solve itself. The worst part is when you have to ask yourself, \"Do the DEVs even play their own game?\" or \"Are the DEVS even gamers?\"\n\nAll of the above is true but here is my theory as to why they keep messing up:\n\nUnderlying Issue:\nThe game studio got woke. Yes, I said it. The GAME isn't woke, but the DEVs probably are. Why? You can not be male or female despite male and female voices, you can only be \"Lean\" or \"Brawny\". Why make this uneccessary change where you have to go out of your way to do it? The studio probably got infected and they started hiring woke people and we ALL know woke people are incompetent.\n\nExamples:\n-Concord cost $400-500 mil, studio got shut down, game got shut down, ZERO profits.\n-Ubisoft Assassin's Creed Shadows isn't even released yet and tanked their stock  90%\n-Bioware Dragon Age Veilguard performed worse than a lot of INDIE games with a AAA budget.\n\nIts just pattern recognition, friends.", "timestamp_created": 1731713179, "timestamp_updated": 1731713256, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.369049578